***********************************************
BUILD INSTRUCTIONS
***********************************************

1. Prework for build

  1-1. Build linux kernel

  1-2. Make symbolic link to kernel
      $ cd driver/product
      $ ln -s  <YOUR KERNELDIR PATH> linux

      for example:
        $ ln -s /home/hwanwook.lee/kernel/linux-3.15-xxx linux
  1-3. Select GPU hardware platform
      $ export MIDG_HARDWARE_PLATFORM=O18_PLATFORM

2. Build DDK driver

    $ cd driver/product/kernel
    $ make

    And then you can see a output dir(=driver/product/result_kernel).
